## ----fig6,fig.cap="Ratios of death rates (top left – 50 vs 60; top right – 60 vs 70; bottom left – 70 vs 80; bottom right – 80 vs 90) from STAR (dashed lines) and LC (dotted lines) models using Australian male data of years 1980-2021 and ages 50-90.",echo=FALSE,results='hide',out.width="50%",fig.show='hold',warning=FALSE,message=FALSE----
